    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Three-bedroom Semi-Detached Family Residence\nConnaughton Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this exceptional three-bedroom semi-detached residence at 7 Fortbarrington Drive, Dun Brinn, Athy.\nThis impressive family home has been thoughtfully reconfigured and upgraded to create a bright, modern and highly practical living space. The property has been designed with contemporary family living in mind and benefits from a single-storey extension to the rear, a block-built shed, private gated parking and easily maintained grounds. \nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a stylish modern kitchen with built-in appliances, separate utility room with plumbing for washing machine, and a large bright sitting room featuring an open fireplace. The formal dining room provides an excellent additional reception space and could also be utilised as a downstairs bedroom if required. A modern shower room completes the ground floor accommodation.\nUpstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from built-in wardrobes and a private en-suite. A family bathroom completes the first floor.\nOutside, the property benefits from a gated entrance leading to a paved private driveway, providing excellent off-street parking. The front garden is neatly laid out with raised flower beds, while the rear garden provides a private outdoor space ideal for family use. A substantial block-built shed provides excellent additional storage.\nThe property is equipped with gas-fired central heating, a modern combi boiler and double-glazed windows.\nBer rating C\nLocation\nFortbarrington Drive is situated within the popular Dun Brinn development, conveniently located within easy reach of Athy town centre and a host of local amenities. Athy offers an excellent range of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and community amenities.\nThe property is also ideally positioned for enjoying Athy`s excellent riverside amenities, including the Barrow River and Grand Canal, with walking and cycling routes and the newly developed Blueway providing superb recreational facilities close by.\nFor commuters, the property enjoys excellent access to the Athy Distributor Road, providing convenient connections to the regional road network and onward access towards the M9 motorway. Athy railway station is also within easy reach, offering regular rail services to Dublin and other destinations.\nThis is a truly exceptional family home which has been cleverly reconfigured to provide bright, spacious and versatile accommodation in a highly convenient location. The quality of presentation and thoughtful layout make this a property that is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and those looking for a modern home ready for immediate occupation.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this outstanding property has to offer.\nViewings are strictly by appointment with Connaughton Auctioneers.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.82m (6'0\") x 4.08m (13'5\")\nTimber floor, teak front door. stairs, curtains\n\nKitchen - 3.09m (10'2\") x 3.78m (12'5\")\nWall and floor units. Electric oven, dishwasher, electric hob, extractor fan. Timber laminate flooring, lighting\n\nLiving Room - 5.06m (16'7\") x 3.48m (11'5\")\nFeature fireplace with open fire, Timber laminate flooring, radiator.\n\nDining Room - 4.48m (14'8\") x 3.43m (11'3\")\nLaminate timber flooring, blinds, curtains, radiator, double doors to patio, Velux windows, light fitting\n\nShower Room (Downstairs) - 1.68m (5'6\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\nTiled floor, tiled walls, corner shower cubicle with electric shower, vanity unit, W.C. extractor fan\n\nLaundry Room - 1.85m (6'1\") x 1.21m (4'0\")\nWashing machine, extractor fan, light.\n\nLanding - 2.04m (6'8\") x 2.67m (8'9\")\n\n - 1.06m (3'6\") x 1.54m (5'1\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.48m (14'8\") x 2.94m (9'8\")\nLino flooring, built-in wardrobes, radiator, blinds, curtains,\n\nEn-Suite - 2.88m (9'5\") x 0.79m (2'7\")\nTiled wall, lino flooring, shower cubicle with electric shower, wash hand basin, W.C. radiator\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.55m (8'4\") x 3.75m (12'4\")\nLino flooring, curtains, radiator\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.43m (8'0\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\nLino flooring, curtains, radiator\n\nBathroom - 2.87m (9'5\") x 1.65m (5'5\")\nTiled flooring, tiled walls, Bath, wash hand basin, toilet. hot press\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
